/T (Current systems also treat every vehicle the same. Heavy vehicles like trucks and buses take much longer to start moving and waste far more fuel when stopped repeatedly. Signals give them no extra allowance, so the light turns red before the pack clears and the junction never reaches its best flow.)
/E (Current systems also treat every vehicle the same. Heavy vehicles like trucks and buses take much longer to start moving and waste far more fuel when stopped repeatedly. Signals give them no extra allowance, so the light turns red before the pack clears and the junction never reaches its best flow.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
