/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 821 0 R
/T (PRAVAH introduces dynamic traffic lights at calculated points along the road, not just at junctions. These lights work together across the network, holding and releasing traffic in controlled pulses so that bottlenecks downstream get time to clear before more vehicles arrive. Think of it as putting valves in a water pipe instead of waiting for it to overflow.)
/E (PRAVAH introduces dynamic traffic lights at calculated points along the road, not just at junctions. These lights work together across the network, holding and releasing traffic in controlled pulses so that bottlenecks downstream get time to clear before more vehicles arrive. Think of it as putting valves in a water pipe instead of waiting for it to overflow.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
