<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 822 0 R
/T (To make these lights intelligent, we use two types of sensing. GNSS data gives the system a long range view of how much traffic is approaching from a distance, while cameras at the junction give the immediate picture of what is happening right now. Together they give each light both foresight and awareness, something no deployed system currently does.)
/E (To make these lights intelligent, we use two types of sensing. GNSS data gives the system a long range view of how much traffic is approaching from a distance, while cameras at the junction give the immediate picture of what is happening right now. Together they give each light both foresight and awareness, something no deployed system currently does.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
