284 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 174 0 R
/T (PRAVAH treats city traffic like water in a pipe. Instead of letting vehicles flow continuously until a bottleneck floods, we break the flow into controlled pulses. A continuous stream of traffic is hard to manage, but smaller packets of vehicles are far easier to time, direct and clear. Dynamic traffic lights placed at calculated distances along the road, not just at junctions, hold and release these packets in sync so that downstream points get time to clear before more traffic arrives.)
/E (PRAVAH treats city traffic like water in a pipe. Instead of letting vehicles flow continuously until a bottleneck floods, we break the flow into controlled pulses. A continuous stream of traffic is hard to manage, but smaller packets of vehicles are far easier to time, direct and clear. Dynamic traffic lights placed at calculated distances along the road, not just at junctions, hold and release these packets in sync so that downstream points get time to clear before more traffic arrives.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
285 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 174 0 R
/T (Each light makes decisions using two eyes. GNSS data shows what is coming from far away. Cameras show what is happening right now. Together they give the system both foresight and immediate awareness. This same sensing identifies heavy vehicles so the signal adjusts for their slower startup, spots emergency vehicles early to prepare a green corridor ahead of them, and monitors road health by tracking speed patterns over time to flag problems to authorities automatically.)
/E (Each light makes decisions using two eyes. GNSS data shows what is coming from far away. Cameras show what is happening right now. Together they give the system both foresight and immediate awareness. This same sensing identifies heavy vehicles so the signal adjusts for their slower startup, spots emergency vehicles early to prepare a green corridor ahead of them, and monitors road health by tracking speed patterns over time to flag problems to authorities automatically.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
