1666 0 obj
<<
/Title (Every person on the road. A school child whose thirty minute bus ride stretches to over an hour. A working professional who left on time but still walks into office late because the road would not move. An elderly person in a car with family, exhausted by a trip that should have been simple. And a patient in an ambulance, where every minute stuck in traffic can mean the difference between life and death. Congestion does not choose who it slows down. If you are on the road, you are in it.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1652 0 R
/Prev 1665 0 R
>>
