1708 0 obj
<<
/Title (PRAVAH treats city traffic like water in a pipe. Instead of letting vehicles flow continuously until a bottleneck floods, we break the flow into controlled pulses. A continuous stream of traffic is hard to manage, but smaller packets of vehicles are far easier to time, direct and clear. Dynamic traffic lights placed at calculated distances along the road, not just at junctions, hold and release these packets in sync so that downstream points get time to clear before more traffic arrives.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1695 0 R
/Next 1721 0 R
>>
endobj
